With all four indices, the full cost function becomes:

$$\mathcal{L}_\text{total} = \underbrace{\sum_s \text{pop}_s \cdot (\text{votePower}_s - 1.0)^2}_{\text{Electoral Distortion}} + \lambda_1 \cdot \underbrace{\sum_s \text{SPI}_s \cdot \text{votePower}_s}_{\text{Structural Preservation}} + \lambda_2 \cdot \underbrace{\sum_s \text{SCI}_s \cdot \text{votePower}_s}_{\text{Spatial Control}} + \lambda_3 \cdot \underbrace{\sum_s \text{ILI}_s \cdot \text{votePower}_s}_{\text{Influence Laundering}}$$

And the **Compound Disenfranchisement Score** for an individual voter:

$$\text{CDS} = \text{VotePower} \times \text{SPI} \times \text{SCI} \times \text{ILI}$$

This captures the **full corruption stack**: electoral distortion × structural preservation × spatial control × influence laundering.

