```
A → B: Find_Value(block_X)
B:     "Not found"
       EBF_{B→A}.insert(hash(X))     ← TTL = 3600s, wheel slot = 47

... 20 minutes pass, A requests block_X again ...

A → B: Find_Value(block_X)
B:     "Still don't have it"
       EBF_{B→A}.refresh(hash(X))    ← moves to slot 67, resets TTL

... 30 minutes later, B inhales block_X from C ...

B:     EBF_{B→A}.query(hash(X)) → true
B → A: Push(block_X, reason="recall")
A → B: Push_Ack
