### 4. EBF Memory Per Connection

Each connection from B→A maintains:

```
connection_memory_t
├── ebf: ElasticBloomFilter (fast mem: bit array, slow mem: bucket array)
├── wheel: TimingWheel (64 slots × 60s = 64 min max memory)
└── last_tick: timestamp
