## Integration with Respiration

The Store algorithm is used in two contexts:

### 1. New Block Replication (Originator)

```plaintext
ON-NEW-BLOCK-CREATED(node, block):
  // Store locally first
  store_locally(node, block)

  // Find REPLICATION_FACTOR additional nodes
  msg = {
    block_hash:       hash(block),
    block_size:       size(block),
    block_fib:        0,
    replicas_needed:  REPLICATION_FACTOR,  // e.g., 3
    max_hops:         6,
    visited_bloom:    empty_bloom(),
    path:             [node.id],
    path_len:         1,
    start_time:       now(),
    carry_data:       true,
    block_data:       block
  }

  FORWARD-STORE(msg)
```

### 2. Exhalation (Shedding)

```plaintext
EXHALE-CYCLE(node):
  if node.capacity < 0.80: return

  to_free = blocks_to_reach(node, target = 0.50)
  cold = get_cold_blocks_sorted_by_ejection_date(node)

  for i = 0; i < min(to_free, cold.length); i++:
    entry = cold[i]
    block = load_from_sections(node.sections, entry)

    msg = {
      block_hash:       entry.hash,
      block_size:       get_block_size(entry),
      block_fib:        entry.counter.fib,
      replicas_needed:  1,           // just need one taker
      max_hops:         4,           // shorter search for exhalation
      visited_bloom:    empty_bloom(),
      path:             [node.id],
      path_len:         1,
      start_time:       now(),
      carry_data:       true,
      block_data:       block
    }

    FORWARD-STORE(msg)

    // On any acceptance: remove locally
    // On failure: block stays, try again next cycle
```

