## Integration into Store Forwarding

```c
void forward_store(store_msg_t* msg) {
  candidates = gather_candidates_from_rings(msg);

  // Tier 1: candidates with fresh gossip data — use cached metrics
  // Tier 2: candidates with stale data — ping them first
  // Tier 3: candidates that fail ping — drop

  tier1 = [];  // fresh, use immediately
  tier2 = [];  // stale, needs probe

  for each c in candidates:
    age = now() - c.last_gossip_time;
    if age < GOSSIP_STALE_THRESHOLD_MS && c.consecutive_fails == 0:
      tier1.push(c);
    else if c.consecutive_fails < MAX_FAILS:
      tier2.push(c);
    // else: silently drop

  // Probe tier2 in parallel
  if tier2 is not empty:
    send CAPACITY_QUERY to all tier2 peers;
    await responses with timeout;
    // Merge responders into tier1 with fresh data

  // Roulette-wheel from tier1 using composite S(j)
  forward_via_roulette(msg, tier1);
}
```

