## Updated Ring Member Structure

```c
typedef struct {
  node_id_t   id;
  uint32_t    latency;              // last measured RTT (ms)
  float       weight;               // Hebbian w_ij
  float       capacity;             // last known capacity [0, 1]
  uint8_t     phase;                // INHALE / NEUTRAL / EXHALE
  uint64_t    last_gossip_time;     // when capacity was last updated
  float       availability;         // EWMA [0, 1]
  uint32_t    consecutive_fails;    // missed pings
} ring_member_t;
```

The `capacity` and `phase` fields come from gossip. The `availability` and `consecutive_fails` come from ping. The `weight` comes from Hebbian learning. All three feed into \(S(j)\).

