## Capacity-Phase Modulation

Rate limits tighten as the node fills up:

```c
float capacity_multiplier(float capacity, rpc_type_e type) {
  if (type == RPC_STORE || type == RPC_PUSH) {
    // Inhale (0-50%): full rate
    // Neutral (50-80%): tapering
    // Exhale (80%+): near zero
    if (capacity < 0.50) return 1.0;
    if (capacity < 0.80) return 1.0 - (capacity - 0.50) / 0.30;
    return 0.05;  // barely accepting
  }

  // Lookups always allowed (routing is cheap)
  if (type == RPC_FIND_VALUE) return 1.0;

  // Everything else: mild taper
  if (capacity < 0.80) return 1.0;
  return 0.5;
}
```

