## Key Design Decisions ✅

| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
|:---|---:|:---|
| **Curve for ECDSA** | secp256k1 | Fast, well-supported in OpenSSL |
| **Hash function** | SHA-256 | Sufficient for state hashing |
| **ABE scheme** | CP-ABE (BSW) | Most natural for policy-on-ciphertext |
| **Vault encryption** | Each user's key under `user_id:<id>` | Simple, proven, collusion-resistant |
| **Serialization** | Custom binary format | Compact, no external dependency |
| **Privacy mode** | Optional `signer_id` field | Same code path, different field |

