## The Full Dynamic Lifecycle 🔄

```plaintext
TIME ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────►

Setup     Add User 1    Transition    Add User 2    Revoke User 1
  │          │              │             │              │
  ▼          ▼              ▼             ▼              ▼
┌──────┐  ┌───────┐  ┌───────────┐  ┌───────┐  ┌──────────────┐
│State │  │Vault  │  │Transition │  │Vault  │  │User 1's keys │
│Machine│  │gets   │  │applied by │  │gets   │  │removed from  │
│born  │  │User 1 │  │User 1     │  │User 2 │  │vault         │
│      │  │keys   │  │           │  │keys   │  │              │
│Policies│  │       │  │Log entry 1│  │       │  │User 1 can no │
│defined│  │       │  │           │  │       │  │longer sign   │
└──────┘  └───────┘  └───────────┘  └───────┘  └──────────────┘

                    User 2 can now     User 1's past sigs
                    sign transitions   remain in log (valid)
```

