## Protocol States for Resources

```plaintext
Resource "treasury" protocol:

  ┌─────────┐
  │  IDLE   │  ← Initial state. Resource available.
  └────┬────┘
       │ LOCK operation
       ▼
  ┌─────────┐
  │ LOCKED  │  ← Resource claimed. Only the lock holder can operate.
  └────┬────┘
       │ TRANSFER / WITHDRAW / DEPOSIT operations
       ▼
  ┌────────────┐
  │ MODIFIED   │  ← Data changed. Awaiting verification.
  └────┬───────┘
       │ VERIFY operation (checks invariants)
       ▼
  ┌────────────┐
  │ VERIFIED   │  ← Invariants passed. Ready to release.
  └────┬───────┘
       │ UNLOCK operation
       ▼
  ┌─────────┐
  │  IDLE   │  ← Resource available again.
  └─────────┘

Alternative path (verification fails):
  MODIFIED → ROLLBACK → IDLE
  (reverts to pre-lock state)
