## Multiple Resources, Independent Protocols

Each resource has its own independent protocol state:

```plaintext
State = {
    treasury:  {value: 90, protocol_state: "idle"},
    seats:     {value: 48, protocol_state: "locked", lock_holder: "alice"},
    members:   {value: {alice, bob}, protocol_state: "idle"},
    doc_42:    {value: "Hello...", protocol_state: "idle"}
}

An operation can touch MULTIPLE resources:

crabs_operation_t op = {
    .type = "transfer_from_treasury_to_seats",
    .resources = {"treasury", "seats"},
    .required_state = {
        "treasury": "locked",    // Must be locked first
        "seats": "idle"          // Seats don't need locking for this
    },
    .next_state = {
        "treasury": "modified",
        "seats": "modified"      // Both get modified
    }
};
