## Why This Is Like Parsing

```plaintext
Grammar:                          Operations:

<resource_op> ::=                  Sequence:
  LOCK <body> UNLOCK                 lock → transfer → verify → unlock

<body> ::=                         While locked:
  <modify> <verify>                   modify → verify
  | <modify> <rollback>               modify → rollback

<modify> ::=                       What you can do while locked:
  TRANSFER                           transfer
  | WITHDRAW                         withdraw
  | DEPOSIT                          deposit

The state machine is a PARSER for this grammar.
Invalid sequences are syntax errors.
```

