## Policy Integration: Scheme-Aware Policies

Policies can now reference signature schemes:

```plaintext
// Traditional: any ECDSA key
"role:admin"

// Scheme-specific: must use post-quantum
"role:admin AND sig_scheme:dilithium_3"

// Multi-scheme: ECDSA OR post-quantum
"role:admin AND (sig_scheme:ecdsa_secp256k1 OR sig_scheme:dilithium_3)"

// Key rotation: accept old scheme during transition period
"role:admin AND (sig_scheme:ecdsa_secp256k1 OR sig_scheme:ed25519)"
```

This enables **graceful migration** between signature schemes:

```plaintext
Phase 1: ECDSA only
  policy: "role:admin AND sig_scheme:ecdsa_secp256k1"

Phase 2: Transition (both accepted)
  policy: "role:admin AND (sig_scheme:ecdsa_secp256k1 OR sig_scheme:ed25519)"

Phase 3: Ed25519 only
  policy: "role:admin AND sig_scheme:ed25519"

Phase 4: Post-quantum
  policy: "role:admin AND sig_scheme:dilithium_3"
```

