  Use case: Collaborative documents, comments, descriptions

Type ID: 0x12  LEVIEN_TABLE
  Operations: insert_row(pos), delete_row(pos), move_row(from, to),
              insert_col(pos), delete_col(pos), move_col(from, to),
              set_cell(row, col, value)
  Transform: 2D transform matrix
  Use case: Spreadsheets, data tables, schedules

Type ID: 0x13  LEVIEN_TREE
  Operations: insert_node(parent, pos, node), delete_node(id),
              reparent(id, new_parent, pos), reorder(id, new_pos)
  Transform: Tree-aware transform (children shift with parent)
  Use case: File systems, org charts, category hierarchies
```

