## Critical Deployment Decision

How you deploy this depends entirely on **privilege level**:

### Option A: System Service (init.rc)
```bash
# /system/etc/init/pubsub.rc
service pubsub_daemon /system/bin/pubsub_daemon
    class core
    user system
    group system
    seclabel u:r:pubsub_daemon:s0
```

**Requirements:**
- System signature or platform key
- SELinux policy definitions (`pubsub_daemon.te`)
- Can call `defaultServiceManager()->addService(String16(PUBSUB_SERVICE_NAME), service)`

**Client Access:**
```cpp
sp<IServiceManager> sm = defaultServiceManager();
sp<IBinder> binder = sm->getService(String16(PUBSUB_SERVICE_NAME));
