## The Reliability Stack

```plaintext
Client Request
      ↓
[1] Explicit startForegroundService() [Android 8+]
      ↓
[2] bindService() [always works if service exists]
      ↓
[Service Process Starts or Resumes]
      ↓
[3] Service calls startForeground() within 5s
      ↓
[4] DeathRecipient monitors link
      ↓
[5] BOOT_COMPLETED restart + AlarmManager backup
