## The Reality Check

| Scenario | Will Service Run? |
|----------|-------------------|
| Fresh boot, no user interaction | **Maybe** (if BOOT_COMPLETED not blocked) |
| User swiped away service app from recents | **No** (unless whitelisted) |
| Doze mode (screen off, stationary) | **Deferred** (alarms delayed) |
| Xiaomi/Samsung aggressive power save | **No** (unless whitelisted) |
| Low memory pressure | **Killed** (START_STICKY may restart) |

**Design for failure:**
- Queue messages locally in client if service unavailable
- Show "Service not running" UI with "Start Service" button
- Use `JobScheduler` for non-urgent operations (guaranteed to run eventually)

